docs/reviews/frame-computer-science-grade-8-codex-2026-11-25.md:5:## Verdict
docs/reviews/frame-computer-science-grade-8-codex-2026-11-25.md:7:**Needs fixes before scope and sequence writing.** The five-unit structure, progression placement and calendar are sound, but the frame assumes the previous elective was taken and leaves several required data actions insufficiently specified. Add the entry bridges, complete those teaching and assessment promises, and correct the source map while preserving the five units and 64-day budget.
